# Genuinely unused files created by the artifact scaffold. Everything else
# under src/ is imported by the application and MUST stay tracked: lib/ holds
# the API client, components/ui/ the design-system primitives, and hooks/ the
# data hooks. Ignoring them produced a repository whose site could not build.
components.json
src/assets/

